            "review_title": "Review at Yakiuo Ishikawa Saigon",
            "review_text": "RonTang\nSingapore, Singapore534 contributions\n0\nEnjoyable & Pleasant Dining Experience\nSep 2026 • Couples\nWe were at the restaurant for omakase dinner. It is a cozy small place located in Thao Dien (formerly District 2). The ingredients are fresh and well presented. Seasoning and condiments provided tastes which are complimentary to the way the food is prepared or cooked. We were waited upon and served by Ms. Thuy Khue. She made a wonderful effort in explaining in English, each ingredient and each dish served to us. Her service made our dining experience delightful. Menu prices are reasonable, considering the freshness of ingredients used. This restaurant is suitable for couples, small gathering among friends and family. We will definitely return another time.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 8, 2026",
